    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Ce qui / ce que / ce dont + c'est",
     "texto": [
      "The highlighted part goes at the beginning with **ce qui** (subject), **ce que** (object) or **ce dont** (with «de»), and then **c'est**: **Ce qui compte, c'est la santé** (what matters is health)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Same use as «qui», «que», «dont»",
     "texto": [
      "The rules are those of the relative pronouns from lesson 23: **qui** with the subject, **que** with the object, **dont** with «de»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
